==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|eye-socket}}, {{l|en|eyesocket}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|eye|socket}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} The bony cavity which contains the [[eyeball]] and its associated [[muscle]]s, vessels, and [[nerve]]s. In [[human]]s, seven [[bone]]s make up each bony orbit.

====Meronyms====
* {{qualifier|bones making up the eye socket}} [[frontal bone]], [[zygomatic bone]], [[maxilla]], [[sphenoid bone]], [[ethmoid bone]], [[palatine bone]],  [[lacrimal bone]]

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|cranial orbit}}
* {{l|en|orbit}}
* {{l|en|orbital cavity}}

